 architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"대조 학습","label":"대조 학습","summary":"관련된 표본의 표현을 가깝게, 비교 대상의 표현은 구별되게 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/92b1e658761785ee2014193c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"T5 기반 모델의 FFN을 희소 전문가로 확장.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan","@type":"Paper","author":["Ian J. Goodfellow","Jean Pouget-Abadie","Mehdi Mirza","Bing Xu","David Warde-Farley","Sherjil Ozair","Aaron Courville","Yoshua Bengio"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Generative Adversarial Networks","label":"Generative Adversarial Networks","reference_year":2014,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1406.2661"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a2edc9dff98fc3aa17ef90cd","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"explanation":"Inception · GoogLeNet: 합성곱.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/inception"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i