5d80d72d2e63","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"원 논문의 인코더/디코더 블록 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/image_text","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"영상–텍스트 연결","label":"영상–텍스트 연결","summary":"영상과 자연어 표현의 의미적 대응을 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c94e74a4de3ff4d62ef1a568","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/segmentation","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"영상 분할","label":"영상 분할","summary":"영상의 위치별 범주를 예측합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9ee640ed1c200b5666585d23","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"대표 참고 문헌입니다. 연도는 이 문헌 기준이며 모델 계열의 최초 발명 연도를 단정하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"합성곱","label":"합성곱","summary":"공간의 작은 영역에 필터를 적용해 지역적 패턴을 추출합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer","@type":"Paper","author":["Ashish Vaswani","Noam Shazeer","Niki Parmar","Jakob Uszkoreit","Llion Jones","Aidan N. Gomez","Łukasz Kaiser","Illia Polosukhin"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Attention Is All You Need","label":"Attention Is All You Need","reference_year":2017,"summary":"모델과 개념을 설명하는 대표 문헌입니다. 원문에서 해당 구조와 주장 범위를 확인할 수 있습니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3b8cafd4c3dcea14c69dbe6e","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"explanation":"합성곱 모델 계열의 구체적인 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/unet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fa0d49083a7e8f171bca6fe6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn"},"explanation":"Graph Convolutional Network: 그래프 메시지 전달.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gcn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba","@type":"Paper","author":["Albert Gu","Tri Dao"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Mamba: Linear-Time Sequence Modeling with Selective State Spaces","label":"Mamba: Linear-Time Sequence Modeling with Selective State Spaces","reference_year":2023,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.00752"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceptron"},"family":"feedforward","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"MLP","label":"MLP","reference_year":1986,"runtime_id":"mlp","runtime_note":"작은 교육용 구현입니다. 원 논문의 학습 결과를 재현한 사전학습 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"여러 선형 층과 비선형 활성화를 쌓아 입력 표현을 바꿉니다. 1986년 문헌은 대표적인 역전파 학습 설명에 연결됩니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weighted_sum"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c9c245accf75f3dc5d6b72d5","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"explanation":"구조를 이루는 주요 구성 요소.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch","@type":"Paper","author":["William Fedus","Barret Zoph","Noam Shazeer"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Switch Transformers: Scaling to Trillion Parameter Models with Simple and Efficient Sparsity","label":"Switch Transformers: Scaling to Trillion Parameter Models with Simple and Efficient Sparsity","reference_year":2021,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.03961"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b2e95317a819d53e81441100","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"explanation":"대표 참고 문헌입니다. 연도는 이 문헌 기준이며 모델 계열의 최초 발명 연도를 단정하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg","@type":"Paper","author":["Karen Simonyan","Andrew Zisserman"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Very Deep Convolutional Networks for Large-Scale Image Recognition","label":"Very Deep Convolutional Networks for Large-Scale Image Recognition","reference_year":2014,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.1556"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/75cbd11499e5564b726883ec","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"Switch Transformer: Span corruption.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/span_corruption"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/08516a0d8ac5304525e4ada6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"explanation":"RoFormer: Self-Attention.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/roformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_aggregation","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"이웃 집계","label":"이웃 집계","summary":"그래프 이웃의 표현을 결합.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/causal_mask","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"인과적 마스킹","label":"인과적 마스킹","summary":"현재 위치에서 미래 위치의 토큰 정보를 가리는 제약."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5","@type":"Model","applied_to":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/understanding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/translation"}],"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"family":"attention","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"T5","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"T5","label":"T5","reference_year":2019,"runtime_id":"t5","runtime_note":"Transformers T5: 폭 16, encoder/decoder 각 1층. 상대 위치 bias·교차 어텐션·공유 임베딩을 포함합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"다양한 언어 과제를 text-to-text 형식으로 통합한 인코더–디코더 모델.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/span_corruption"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/relative_position"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/elman"},"family":"sequence","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/recurrent"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"RNN · Elman 계열","label":"RNN · Elman 계열","reference_year":1990,"runtime_id":"rnn","runtime_note":"작은 교육용 구현입니다. 원 논문의 학습 결과를 재현한 사전학습 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"같은 순환 연산과 이전 상태를 반복해 시퀀스의 문맥을 표현합니다. 실행 예제에서 출력과 숨은 상태를 함께 관찰할 수 있습니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weight_sharing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/window_attention","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"윈도 어텐션","label":"윈도 어텐션","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},"summary":"제한된 지역 창 안에서 계산하는 self-attention."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/inception","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Inception · GoogLeNet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"INCEPTION","label":"Inception · GoogLeNet","reference_year":2014,"runtime_id":"inception","runtime_note":"torchvision GoogLeNet의 병렬 Inception 분기. 보조 분류기를 끈 64×64 입력 예제입니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"서로 다른 크기의 특징 경로를 결합하는 다중 스케일 합성곱 구조.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multiscale"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0d70941a45ac8d791cf8359c","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"구조를 이루는 주요 구성 요소.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d72281c603550ab1a08c3798","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"explanation":"T5: Cross-Attention.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/44be00e36436ca8149e8de73","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"explanation":"Variational Autoencoder: 잠재 분포 인코더.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_encoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9ada8cbb216fc95bb5722abb","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"explanation":"LLaMA · 2023: RMSNorm.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/llama"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rms_norm"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/61cd1f743f57e4aa037d45a2","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"explanation":"Inception · GoogLeNet: 영상 분류.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/inception"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/expert","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Feed-forward 전문가","label":"Feed-forward 전문가","summary":"일부 입력에 선택되어 활성화되는 FFN.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/03707b806a210f4d2234e018","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"explanation":"MLP의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weighted_sum"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/eabf372c9469142580368aa8","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"explanation":"BERT: 위치별 FFN.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/bert"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/routing","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"전문가 라우팅","label":"전문가 라우팅","summary":"토큰을 처리할 전문가를 선택합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a67a774acb0c84dd5f9ff362","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/densenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2b69738295f877c86b388eb0","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"Switch Transformer: 전문가 라우팅.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/routing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shifted_windows","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"이동 윈도","label":"이동 윈도","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/window_attention"},"summary":"인접한 블록의 윈도 배치를 이동시켜 창 사이 정보를 연결합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e287f9e8659ad3d22ff5e310","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"explanation":"ResNet의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/7b1b15c0ed00c537d01dc096","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/depthwise"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet","@type":"Paper","author":["Olaf Ronneberger","Philipp Fischer","Thomas Brox"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"U-Net: Convolutional Networks for Biomedical Image Segmentation","label":"U-Net: Convolutional Networks for Biomedical Image Segmentation","reference_year":2015,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1505.04597"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/dba8f2d740f86557f12e9364","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"explanation":"GPT-2: 위치별 FFN.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gpt2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"역전파","label":"역전파","summary":"출력에서 시작한 미분 정보를 연결된 연산으로 전달해 학습 파라미터의 기울기를 구합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/unet","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/segmentation"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"U-Net","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"UNET","label":"U-Net","reference_year":2015,"runtime_id":"unet","runtime_note":"2단계 U-Net 축소 예제. encoder–decoder와 skip concatenation을 포함하며 padding으로 공간 크기를 보존합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"축소 경로와 확장 경로 사이 특징 연결을 이용한 영상 분할 모델.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/skip_connections"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/dd98978fd6eed699d5236a2d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/roformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/564514527fbb702778bcb970","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"explanation":"DenseNet: 영상 분류.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/densenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c640b8c7070a04da9562aa94","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm"},"explanation":"LSTM의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/lstm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/memory_cell"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"위치별 FFN","label":"위치별 FFN","summary":"각 위치의 표현에 동일한 피드포워드 변환을 적용합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/51fe4ca19a31a9f24040be6b","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"explanation":"게이트를 추가한 순환 유닛으로 비교합니다. LSTM의 단순한 후속 버전이라는 직선 계보를 뜻하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gru"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet","@type":"Paper","author":["Yann LeCun","Léon Bottou","Yoshua Bengio","Patrick Haffner"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Gradient-Based Learning Applied to Document Recognition","label":"Gradient-Based Learning Applied to Document Recognition","reference_year":1998,"summary":"모델과 개념을 설명하는 대표 문헌입니다. 원문에서 해당 구조와 주장 범위를 확인할 수 있습니다.","url":{"@id":"https://doi.org/10.1109/5.726791"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/32c58c795432df8a8ea6326a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"explanation":"T5: 기계 번역.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/t5"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/translation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b261ff78956d0b2270d1a719","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://ww