","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/2ee2ab1c0edbe3684ec1674f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/convnext"},"explanation":"ConvNeXt: 지도 분류 목적.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/convnext"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/convnext"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/720376b395cb7da9fc19423b","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"explanation":"VGG: 영상 분류.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vgg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/77a71e41dd8a11e532f4a459","@type":"Claim","basis":"pedagogical","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"explanation":"단일 가중합 유닛에서 다층 비선형 네트워크로 학습 범위를 넓히는 교육적 연결입니다. 직접적인 역사적 계승을 단정하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceptron"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/denoising","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"확산 노이즈 예측","label":"확산 노이즈 예측","summary":"잡음 수준에 조건부인 노이즈 예측 목적."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/016d55e9773aa109dfcb25c6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"Swin Transformer: 윈도 어텐션.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/window_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/fb995442d474c5152a59904d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"explanation":"MobileNet: 합성곱 특징 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mobilenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e4707bfc7ab2275c22692777","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"explanation":"MLP의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/graph_attention","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"그래프 어텐션","label":"그래프 어텐션","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"},"summary":"이웃 노드의 특징에 따라 집계 가중치를 정합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/84af8c00958d4d3f9b50bb4e","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/expert"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3129ad0a1c970cbafe79437f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"explanation":"LLaMA · 2023: SwiGLU.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/llama"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/llama"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/swiglu"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multiscale","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"다중 스케일 처리","label":"다중 스케일 처리","summary":"서로 다른 수용 영역과 해상도의 특징을 결합합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/aa1ba89cbc207d8ce6f4b2db","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"원 논문의 인코더/디코더 블록 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/d1497325fb2cfd450f1e4a17","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":