}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a10102915644ddfb6ebb8822","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"explanation":"Vision Transformer: 위치별 FFN.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/cross_attention","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Cross-Attention 블록","label":"Cross-Attention 블록","summary":"디코더 질의를 인코더 메모리와 결합.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5c57b93d487a34b9d3a842d6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"Swin Transformer: 지도 분류 목적.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/denoising","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"노이즈 제거","label":"노이즈 제거","summary":"손상된 자료에서 잡음이나 깨끗한 신호를 추정합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3cd16adc053408b521e5f128","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm"},"explanation":"DDPM: 확산 노이즈 예측.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/denoising"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/44f7d0f7b78046c0ec518f9a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"Swin Transformer: 영상 분할.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/segmentation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f095a1aafc5c08e2dd4a5c22","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"Switch Transformer: Feed-forward 전문가.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/expert"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ad1f5c0f353aa8379b570ec8","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"explanation":"CNN · LeNet 계열의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer","@type":"Model","alternative_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"family":"attention","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/positions"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Transformer","label":"Transformer","reference_year":2017,"runtime_id":"seq2seq","runtime_note":"작은 인코더–디코더 예제: 정현파 위치 인코딩, 인과적 디코더 마스크, 교차 어텐션을 포함합니다. 임의 초기화와 teacher forcing을 사용하며 번역 학습이나 사전학습 가중치는 포함하지 않습니다.","summary":"Self-Attention과 FFN, 잔차 연결로 시퀀스 표현을 갱신합니다. 실행 예제는 위치 인코딩·인과적 마스크·교차 어텐션을 포함하는 작은 인코더–디코더이며, 논문의 학습된 전체 모델 재현은 아닙니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f57bfbd8e4c72b121fe173d4","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/router"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/routing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/0488a97b28358be04eac0ab6","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"}},{"@id":"https:/