/rdf-schema#label":"잠재 분포 인코더","label":"잠재 분포 인코더","summary":"자료를 조건부 잠재 분포로 변환.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_variable"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/contrastive","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"영상–텍스트 대조 목적","label":"영상–텍스트 대조 목적","summary":"배치 내 영상과 텍스트의 대응을 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/44e699bdae6976d6a2ecf20d","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"explanation":"Graph Attention Network: 지도 분류 목적.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gat"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm","@type":"Paper","author":["Jonathan Ho","Ajay Jain","Pieter Abbeel"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models","label":"Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models","reference_year":2020,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.11239"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/3bc5eab7947815a57cb7cd61","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"explanation":"합성곱 모델 계열의 구체적인 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/efficientnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/37e1872161cc7fcd747712ae","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"explanation":"GPT-2: Self-Attention 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gpt2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder","@type":"Component","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Transformer 인코더 블록","label":"Transformer 인코더 블록","summary":"Self-Attention과 FFN으로 입력 표현을 구성.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/f08e1c2601d89d660af07502","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"원 논문의 인코더/디코더 블록 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/85bb08358d295927b663d3fb","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"explanation":"EfficientNet: 합성곱 특징 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/efficientnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/positions","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"위치 표현 모듈","label":"위치 표현 모듈","summary":"토큰 위치 정보를 구조에 제공.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"지도 분류 목적","label":"지도 분류 목적","summary":"표지된 자료의 분류 오차를 최적화합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ac7b870d655252bbaa7a6e43","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/understanding","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"언어 이해","label":"언어 이해","summary":"텍스트 문맥에 기반한 분류·추론·질의응답 과제."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/roformer","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/understanding"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"family":"attention","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"RoFormer","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"ROFORMER","label":"RoFormer","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"roformer","runtime_note":"Transformers RoFormer 1층·폭 16. RoPE를 쓰는 양방향 어텐션 구조입니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"회전 위치 임베딩을 어텐션에 결합한 Transformer 계열.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/rotary_position"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/relative_position"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/swiglu","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"SwiGLU","label":"SwiGLU","summary":"SiLU를 이용한 게이트가 있는 feed-forward 활성화."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm","@type":"Paper","author":["Sepp Hochreiter","Jürgen Schmidhuber"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Long Short-Term Memory","label":"Long Short-Term Memory","reference_year":1997,"summary":"모델과 개념을 설명하는 대표 문헌입니다. 원문에서 해당 구조와 주장 범위를 확인할 수 있습니다.","url":{"@id":"https://doi.org/10.1162/neco.1997.9.8.1735"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/reparameterization","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"재매개화","label":"재매개화","summary":"확률 표본을 매개변수와 외부 잡음의 미분 가능한 함수로 표현합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/dc1f1b69f6696b71c5d9510a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/convnext"},"explanation":"ConvNeXt: 잔차 연결.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/convnext"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/convnext"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/14a88b54669504603ac94f23","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"explanation":"Graph Attention Network: 그래프 메시지 전달.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gat"},"targ