itecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gan"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/discriminator"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/00cd23db890ea103273a59a6","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"explanation":"Transformer 구성 요소를 채택하고 입력·마스킹·학습 구성을 변경.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/roformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/skip_connections","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Skip 연결","label":"Skip 연결","summary":"중간 경로를 건너뛰어 특징을 전달하는 연결의 상위 개념."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceptron","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceptron"},"family":"feedforward","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Perceptron","label":"Perceptron","reference_year":1958,"runtime_id":"perceptron","runtime_note":"실제 임계 출력을 사용하는 작은 예제입니다. 미분 불가능한 출력이므로 backward 검증은 지원하지 않습니다.","summary":"가중합과 임계 판단으로 이진 출력을 만드는 단일 유닛부터 살펴봅니다. 임계 연산은 일반적인 역전파로 학습하지 않습니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weighted_sum"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9995ff1d86dedf055f2dbff5","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"explanation":"Mamba: 자기회귀 예측.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit","@type":"Paper","author":["Alexey Dosovitskiy","Lucas Beyer","Alexander Kolesnikov","Dirk Weissenborn","Xiaohua Zhai","Thomas Unterthiner","Mostafa Dehghani","Matthias Minderer","Georg Heigold","Sylvain Gelly","Jakob Uszkoreit","Neil Houlsby"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"An Image is Worth 16x16 Words: Transformers for Image Recognition at Scale","label":"An Image is Worth 16x16 Words: Transformers for Image Recognition at Scale","reference_year":2020,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.11929"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/switch","@type":"Model","applied_to":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/understanding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/translation"}],"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/switch"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/t5"},"family":"attention","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/encoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/expert"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/router"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Switch Transformer","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"SWITCH","label":"Switch Transformer","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"switch","runtime_note":"Transformers Switch 2-expert top-1 routing. encoder와 decoder에 실제 sparse FFN을 포함하며 capacity는 16입니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"T5의 FFN 일부를 희소 전문가와 토큰별 라우팅으로 확장합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/span_corruption"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/cross_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/sparse_experts"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/routing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"패치 임베딩","label":"패치 임베딩","summary":"영상의 패치를 토큰 표현으로 변환합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/bc4735969d690699ad044718","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn"},"explanation":"Graph Convolutional Network: 노드 분류.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gcn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/node_classification"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e3693ee90a130c72a86b7d08","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"explanation":"합성곱 모델 계열의 구체적인 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/densenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/b0e003746b0acaa7ee9fad5c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"explanation":"EfficientNet: 지도 분류 목적.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/efficientnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5f6171d6405d63ab3c27593b","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"explanation":"합성곱 모델 계열의 구체적인 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#extends"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vgg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/relative_position","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"상대 위치 표현","label":"상대 위치 표현","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"},"summary":"토큰 간 거리와 상대 위치를 표현하는 방법."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet","@type":"Paper","author":["Andrew G. Howard","Menglong Zhu","Bo Chen","Dmitry Kalenichenko","Weijun Wang","Tobias Weyand","Marco Andreetto","Hartwig Adam"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"MobileNets: Efficient Convolutional Neural Networks for Mobile Vision Applications","label":"MobileNets: Efficient Convolutional Neural Networks for Mobile Vision Applications","reference_year":2017,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1704.04861"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/adversarial","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"적대적 학습","label":"적대적 학습","summary":"생성자와 판별자의 경쟁을 이용해 분포를 학습합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/18565db2e726f470462b9de9","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"explanation":"U-Net: 합성곱 특징 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/unet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/unet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/generation","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"자료 생성","label":"자료 생성","summary":"학습한 분포로부터 새로운 표본을 생성합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/cbbf3cf88ac523e874fda422","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"explanation":"Variational Autoencoder: Encoder–Decoder.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vae"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/encoder_decoder"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a338ea661b68d453d15a3aea","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm"},"explanation":"DDPM: 자료 생성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/ddpm"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#applied_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/ddpm"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/generation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9851e5196e3975b5f3f36669","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"explanation":"선택적 상태 공간 갱신을 어텐션 기반 시퀀스 처리의 대안으로 제시.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mamba"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#alternative_to"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mamba"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/35fe9f95a0a5f25a1663fbf1","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"explanation":"모델의 대표 문헌.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"locator":"Title / architecture description","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gan"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/densenet","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/densenet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"DenseNet","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"DENSENET","label":"DenseNet","reference_year":2016,"runtime_id":"densenet","runtime_note":"각 블록 1층·growth rate 8로 축소한 torchvision DenseNet. 특징 연결과 전이층을 유지합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"이전 층의 특징을 연결하여 재사용하는 합성곱 네트워크.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/dense_connections"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c625bba07e64abaf6fa75af9","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"explanation":"EfficientNet: 합성곱.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/efficientnet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/efficientnet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a31e3ea5b56ea4e0904d08fb","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"explanation":"Vision Transformer: Self-Attention.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/18c6e7975faec88fa09e2040","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/clip"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/clip"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/text_encoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/contrastive"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/238a1457181a8100fc11e326","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"원 논문의 인코더/디코더 블록 구성.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"locator":"§3.1","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/decoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/cross_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"순환 상태","label":"순환 상태","summary":"이전 시점의 상태를 다음 시점의 계산에 전달합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/735bee4aea5e533885af9941","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"explanation":"Vision Transformer: 패치 임베딩.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gpt2","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/language_modeling"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"family":"attention","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/positions"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"GPT-2","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"GPT2","label":"GPT-2","reference_year":2019,"runtime_id":"gpt2","runtime_note":"작은 실제 Hugging Face GPT-2 구성. 인과적 어텐션과 학습 가능한 위치 임베딩을 포함하며 임의 초기화입니다.","summary":"인과적으로 마스킹된 Transformer 블록을 이용하는 자기회귀 언어 모델.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multihead"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/causal_mask"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/6376b9dd0ea8b74e8010a582","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"explanation":"MobileNet: Depthwise-Separable 합성곱.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/mobilenet"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mobilenet"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/separable_convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/546af6be04027df33951f1f1","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceptron"},"explanation":"대표 참고 문헌입니다. 연도는 이 문헌 기준이며 모델 계열의 최초 발명 연도를 단정하지 않습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceptron"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#documented_in"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceptron"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceptron"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/45a721ef74390da551e40afa","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"explanation":"BERT: 위치 정보.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/bert"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/bert"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gan","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/generation"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gan"},"family":"generative","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/generator"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/discriminator"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"GAN","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"GAN","label":"GAN","reference_year":2014,"runtime_id":"gan","runtime_note":"작은 MLP generator와 discriminator. 생성 표본·진짜 표본의 판별을 한 번 추적하며 교대 학습은 수행하지 않습니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"생성자와 판별자를 함께 학습시키는 적대적 생성 프레임워크.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/adversarial"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_variable"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/adversarial"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/translation","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"기계 번역","label":"기계 번역","summary":"입력 언어 시퀀스를 다른 언어 시퀀스로 변환합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/74079a622f8ed14f7029a22a","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"explanation":"Graph Attention Network: 그래프 어텐션.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gat"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/graph_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/patches","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"패치 투영","label":"패치 투영","summary":"영상 패치를 토큰으로 투영.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/cc17b2efe7f97f90e8e12713","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"explanation":"RoFormer: Self-Attention 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/roformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/c3d5e6a0e919ad60293140ac","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"explanation":"MLP의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/backprop"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/mlp"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification","@type":"Task","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"영상 분류","label":"영상 분류","summary":"영상 입력에 범주를 할당합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/lstm","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lstm"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/rnn"},"family":"sequence","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/recurrent"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"LSTM","label":"LSTM","reference_year":1997,"runtime_id":"lstm","runtime_note":"작은 교육용 구현입니다. 원 논문의 학습 결과를 재현한 사전학습 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"게이트와 셀 상태를 추가해 긴 시점 간 정보와 기울기의 전달을 다룹니다. PyTorch 구현의 현대적 게이트 구성과 원 논문의 구체적 구성은 구별합니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/recurrence"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/gating"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/memory_cell"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gcn","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/node_classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn"},"family":"graph","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/graph_aggregation"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Graph Convolutional Network","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"GCN","label":"Graph Convolutional Network","reference_year":2016,"runtime_id":"gcn","runtime_note":"5개 노드의 2층 GCN. self-loop·대칭 차수 정규화·이웃 집계와 선형 투영을 실행합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"그래프 구조와 노드 특징을 이웃 집계로 함께 학습합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/message_passing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/convnext","@type":"Model","applied_to":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/convnext"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"ConvNeXt","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"CONVNEXT","label":"ConvNeXt","reference_year":2022,"runtime_id":"convnext","runtime_note":"단계당 블록 1개·폭 8/16/32/64의 torchvision ConvNeXt. depthwise convolution과 LayerNorm을 포함합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"ResNet을 현대화하는 설계 실험에서 얻은 순수 합성곱 모델 계열.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/depthwise"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/936ae4d2f453dabfa79e4ea4","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/ffn"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/32006b6e16dcde9c1787689a","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"explanation":"합성곱 네트워크에 잔차 학습 구조를 연결하는 구조적 비교입니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com