PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/separable_convolution","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Depthwise-Separable 합성곱","label":"Depthwise-Separable 합성곱","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},"summary":"채널별 공간 합성곱과 pointwise 채널 결합을 분리합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5fd23d18e1d0b461f16be6b4","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"explanation":"구조를 이루는 주요 구성 요소.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gru"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/recurrent"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin","@type":"Model","applied_to":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/classification"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#task/segmentation"}],"documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"family":"vision","has_component":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/patches"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/self_attention"}],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Swin Transformer","http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel":"SWIN","label":"Swin Transformer","reference_year":2021,"runtime_id":"swin","runtime_note":"torchvision Swin: 두 단계, 작은 2×2 윈도, 단계당 블록 2개. shifted-window와 patch merging을 포함합니다. 모든 가중치는 무작위 초기화이며 학습된 모델이 아닙니다.","summary":"이동 윈도 어텐션과 계층적 해상도로 지역·광역 정보를 결합합니다.","trained_with":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"},"uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/patch_embedding"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/self_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/window_attention"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shifted_windows"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/relative_position"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e80cf77f1762666ec7818765","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"explanation":"VGG: 합성곱.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vgg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gru","@type":"Paper","author":["Kyunghyun Cho","Bart van Merriënboer","Caglar Gulcehre","Dzmitry Bahdanau","Fethi Bougares","Holger Schwenk","Yoshua Bengio"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Learning Phrase Representations using RNN Encoder-Decoder for Statistical Machine Translation","label":"Learning Phrase Representations using RNN Encoder-Decoder for Statistical Machine Translation","reference_year":2014,"summary":"모델과 개념을 설명하는 대표 문헌입니다. 원문에서 해당 구조와 주장 범위를 확인할 수 있습니다.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1406.1078"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/diffusion","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"확산 생성","label":"확산 생성","summary":"점진적인 잡음 주입 과정과 학습한 역과정을 연결합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multihead","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Multi-Head Attention","label":"Multi-Head Attention","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"},"summary":"서로 다른 표현 부분 공간의 어텐션 출력을 결합합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4bd72f50ef6fd8ebbc53d260","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"explanation":"CNN · LeNet 계열의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/Ptw