re / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gat"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"잔차 연결","label":"잔차 연결","subconcept_of":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/skip_connections"},"summary":"변환한 결과에 입력 경로를 더해 정보와 기울기의 전달 경로를 만듭니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/62cd7d3abcead73356e1035c","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"explanation":"GPT-2: Multi-Head Attention.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gpt2"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/gpt2"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multihead"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/position","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"위치 정보","label":"위치 정보","summary":"순서 정보가 필요한 Attention 모델에 위치를 표현하는 신호를 더합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/elbo","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"변분 하한","label":"변분 하한","summary":"잠재 변수 모델의 증거 하한을 최적화합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/cadc4df0bae4a421fb896e27","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"explanation":"Vision Transformer: Multi-Head Attention.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/multihead"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/5b9be01273468705b8ee70d3","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"Swin Transformer: 상대 위치 표현.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/swin"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/relative_position"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9ba2cc0e9e9b8f61f33e108f","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"explanation":"Inception · GoogLeNet: 지도 분류 목적.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/inception"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#trained_with"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/inception"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/supervised"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/43e198ebef22a44a9b948dc5","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"explanation":"RoFormer: 위치별 FFN.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/roformer"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/roformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8ba0eb74a899f4e208f35c4f","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"explanation":"구성 요소의 연산 개념.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vae"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/latent_decoder"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/latent_variable"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/state_space","@type":"Concept","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"상태 공간 모델","label":"상태 공간 모델","summary":"내부 상태의 변화를 이용해 시퀀스 입출력 관계를 표현합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/resnet","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/resnet"},"extends":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"ResNet","label":"ResNet","reference_year":2015,"runtime_id":"resnet18","runtime_note":"TorchVision ResNet18을 무작위 가중치로 실행합니다. vision 추가 의존성이 필요하며 모델 가중치를 다운로드하지 않습니다.","summary":"합성곱 변환에 입력 경로를 더하는 잔차 블록을 이용합니다. 내부 채널 폭과 잔차 출력 폭을 나눠 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/residual"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gcn","@type":"Paper","author":["Thomas N. Kipf","Max Welling"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Semi-Supervised Classification with Graph Convolutional Networks","label":"Semi-Supervised Classification with Graph Convolutional Networks","reference_year":2016,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.02907"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/ae2dc8b6fa952c5d38a2d2df","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceptron"},"explanation":"Perceptron의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/perceptron"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/perceptron"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/8af8eb52360d4f7da8dd7104","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"explanation":"Vision Transformer: 패치 투영.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vit"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vit"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/patches"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/4be715b40b3a7e17e4490232","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"explanation":"Transformer의 대표 구조에서 이 개념을 살펴볼 수 있습니다.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/transformer"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#uses"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/transformer"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/ffn"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/gat","@type":"Paper","author":["Petar Veličković","Guillem Cucurull","Arantxa Casanova","Adriana Romero","Pietro Liò","Yoshua Bengio"],"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Graph Attention Networks","label":"Graph Attention Networks","reference_year":2017,"summary":"이 모델의 구조와 학습 구성을 설명하는 대표 원문.","url":{"@id":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.10903"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/a39a9821e0592a92c6850a2e","@type":"Claim","basis":"structural","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"explanation":"개념 범위의 상하위 관계.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/swin"},"relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#subconcept_of"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/shifted_windows"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/window_attention"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/router","@type":"Component","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"Router","label":"Router","summary":"입력 토큰별 전문가를 선택.","uses":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/routing"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/9c5eb020b13284b9d13c4015","@type":"Claim","basis":"documented","evidence":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"explanation":"VGG: 합성곱 특징 블록.","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/vgg"},"locator":"Model architecture / training / experiments","relation":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#has_component"},"source":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/vgg"},"target":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"}},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#objective/autoregressive","@type":"Objective","http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"자기회귀 예측","label":"자기회귀 예측","summary":"이전 토큰을 조건으로 다음 토큰의 우도를 최적화합니다."},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#model/cnn","@type":"Model","documented_in":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#paper/lenet"},"family":"vision","has_component":{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#component/convolution"},"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label":"CNN · LeNet 계열","label":"CNN · LeNet 계열","reference_year":1998,"runtime_id":"cnn","runtime_note":"작은 교육용 구현입니다. 원 논문의 학습 결과를 재현한 사전학습 모델은 아닙니다.","summary":"지역적 필터와 가중치 공유를 이용해 영상의 패턴을 추출합니다. 대표 문헌은 LeNet 계열이며 실행 예제는 P2I의 작은 CNN입니다.","uses":[{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/convolution"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/weight_sharing"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/activation"},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#concept/backprop"}]},{"@id":"https://github.com/PtwoI/p2i-kg#claim/e47009b97